<title>USA: Sun Micro down, Amgen up after hours.</title>
<headline>Sun Micro down, Amgen up after hours.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Sun Microsystems Inc fell four points to 66, whiles shares of Amgen Inc rose 1-5/8 to 61-1/4 after hours Tuesday, traders said.</p>
<p>After the market closed, Sun Micro reported earnings for the first quarter ended September 29 of $0.63 a share, compared to $0.42 a share the previous first quarter.</p>
<p>Amgen reported third quarter earnings of $0.64 a share versus $0.52 a share.</p>
